OL,3,ATrump and Burnham meeting in New York -
OL,4,Awatch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has warned
OL,7,FIran it should reach a deal with the US
OL,8,For face "annihilation"
OL,10,FHe made the threat while speaking to
OL,11,Fworld leaders at the UN General
OL,12,FAssembly - it was a familiar strategy
OL,13,Fof coercive diplomacy, writes our BBC
OL,14,FPersian correspondent in Washington,
OL,15,FKhashayar Joneidi
OL,17,FOn Ukraine, Trump again claimed an end
OL,18,Fto the war with Russia is near - while
OL,19,Fhe also said the US will rename AI as
OL,20,F"super intelligence"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
