OL,3,ATrump and Burnham meeting in New York -
OL,4,Awatch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 130 heads of state and
OL,7,Fgovernment attend the annual week-long
OL,8,Fevent to deliver a message from their
OL,9,Fnation to the world
OL,11,FOpening this year's session, UN
OL,12,FSecretary General Antonio Guterres said
OL,13,F"faultlines in our world are widening"
OL,15,FTrump is having his first face-to-face
OL,16,Fmeeting with UK Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham, who has said he hopes the pair
OL,18,Fcan find "common ground"
